1
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:08,310
We've tested 1,346 trading rules, in public.

2
00:00:08,870 --> 00:00:10,520
None of them passed the luck check.

3
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:15,810
Every result is published, failures included.

4
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:22,100
Pick any stock or coin, and ten chart checks give it one score.

5
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:25,610
It describes today's chart, not tomorrow's price.

6
00:00:29,650 --> 00:00:31,680
Plans are sized to the risk you set,

7
00:00:33,550 --> 00:00:36,400
and forecasts show how often their range has held.

8
00:00:39,950 --> 00:00:42,370
New rules are locked in before a single result,

9
00:00:42,750 --> 00:00:43,970
then scored in public.

10
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:47,910
Learn the basics,

11
00:00:52,350 --> 00:00:54,080
then practise with paper money.

12
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:08,970
Tickfloor.

13
00:01:09,570 --> 00:01:10,590
Test it first.
